00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:19.272
But the question, why is
production such a long pole?

00:13:19.272 --> 00:13:20.980
Remember, that was
one of the pain points

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.930
that we're addressing
in this talk,

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:25.480
is that it's hard to get
models to production.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.400
I wanted to open that
question up to you guys.

00:13:27.400 --> 00:13:28.900
What are some of
the reasons that it

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.858
takes so long for models
to get into production

00:13:30.858 --> 00:13:31.690
