00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:49.720
like that.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:51.020
Or validation?

00:13:51.020 --> 00:13:52.520
Well, that's a good
point, actually.

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:53.090
Yeah.

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:54.110
And I don't talk too much--

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.610
I hint at that on
