00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.910
You need to get approvals.

00:14:39.910 --> 00:14:41.260
You need to do
capacity planning.

00:14:41.260 --> 00:14:43.093
Some people-- I actually
had a conversation,

00:14:43.093 --> 00:14:44.830
I can't recall
