00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:28.920
But we can go ahead and just
start sending traffic to it.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.860
So you can see that
this piece of code

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:35.210
really boils down to these four
lines, which is essentially one

